        "TileImage": "$($repository a501cb08-07d5-4f7a-b322-af3545e6d528).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. Your targets are currently in  Sapienza, Italy attending a political rally hosted by right-wing politician Marco Abiatti. Your clients have a diverse reason for contacting us. From animal cruelty to money laundering to yellow journalism, it has been made clear to our clients that the world is better off without these celebrities. The targets will most likely stay in crowded areas, so you may need to get creative. Good luck, 47.",
